        "description": "Rechecks original actor/task/capability and transitive source access before and after storage read. Audio/raw response use revision 0; transcript/SRT/VTT default to the current subtitle revision. Decoded WAV is AI generated. Real byte length and SHA-256 accompany content; transcript adds document."
